---
// NY-division footer — intentionally NOT the shared src/components/Footer.astro.
//
// Footer.astro hardcodes MA-specific facts: a LocalBusiness JSON-LD block
// scoped to "Greater Boston," the visible "MA HIC #208336" copyright line, and
// a Boston-condo-owner newsletter headline. None of that is true on these NY
// pages, and per Section 2.4 of JerryCo_OutdoorLiving_Division_Launch_Strategy.md
// ("Legal note... until your own NY license is active, have the Design
// Agreement itself issued through your licensed partner GC... not as a
// standalone Jerry & Co. NY contract"), Jerry & Co. specifically should NOT
// carry an MA-license badge on pages selling NY work. So: same visual
// language (forest/bone/gold, same type scale), no jurisdiction claims —
// leave licensing language to each page's own body copy, where it's already
// funnel-specific and accurate.
---

<footer class="ny-footer">
  <div class="wrap ny-footer-inner">
    <div class="ny-footer-brand">
      <p class="ny-footer-word">Jerry &amp; Co.</p>
      <p class="ny-footer-tag">Home Improvement — NY Division</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ny-footer-links">
      <a href="tel:+13476026801">(347) 602-6801</a>
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="ny-footer-copyright">© 2026 Jerry &amp; Co. Home Improvement LLC — NY Division</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .ny-footer {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bone);
    padding: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px) 0;
  }
  .ny-footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }
  .ny-footer-word {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--bone);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ny-footer-tag {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin: 4px 0 0;
  }
  .ny-footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .ny-footer-links a {
    color: rgba(247, 243, 234, 0.75);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .ny-footer-links a:hover { color: var(--bone); }
  .ny-footer-copyright {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: rgba(247, 243, 234, 0.5);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }
</style>
